OL,3,GNEWSAChristmas hub returns after public
OL,4,A'generosity'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA charitable hub which received over
OL,7,F#10,000 in donations last year is
OL,8,Freturning to a Kent town in the run up
OL,9,Fto Christmas.
OL,11,FFrom Saturday, Maidstone Borough
OL,12,FCouncil and The Mall are collecting
OL,13,Fitems for local charities to distribute
OL,14,Fto those who are struggling and
OL,15,Fotherwise could not be able to
OL,16,Fcelebrate the festive season.
OL,18,FThis year the Christmas Donation hub
OL,19,Fwill support organisations including
OL,20,FAge UK Maidstone, Mid Kent Mind, and
OL,21,FStreet Pastors, who care for those who
OL,22,Fare vulnerable on the street.
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,323,320,200,140,0,100
