OL,3,GNEWSAChristmas hub returns after public
OL,4,A'generosity'
OL,5,
OL,6,FDavid Naghi, cabinet member for
OL,7,Fcommunity cohesion and safety, urged
OL,8,Fpeople not to "stretch" themselves and
OL,9,Fsaid that any contribution will be
OL,10,F"gratefully received".
